{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Hello"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は生駒ちゃんトマトちゃん(大和ちゃん)、まあやの三人でロケをしたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ楽しかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またその話は内容解禁されたら話すね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"帰りの車の中では\nめっちゃ語り合いました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"語りまくりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色々話した結果"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"『自分をしっかりもつこと』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと運転手さんにはうるさいと思われただろうなぁ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三人はどことなく雰囲気が似てるね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんわかしてる"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っていう話をしたり乃木坂について語りました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、前回沢山のコメントありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一つ一つのコメントを心に刻みながら読ませていただきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分では気が付かない事に気づかせてもらえたり、温かい言葉に嬉しくて読んでて文字が見えなくなりました..."},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあやは気が付かない事も沢山あるし、\nまだまだどうやっていったらいいか迷う事も沢山あるし、\n一歩一歩新しい道を歩いてる感じです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真っ直ぐ前だけ見て進める勇気をくれて大切な時間をまあやといてくれて\nありがとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１人１人が大切な人です"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いてくれてありがとう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんな真剣に思ってくださっていて本当に嬉しいです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"一緒に歩いて行ってもらえるように\n頑張ります"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、この前AKB48さんのライブDVD を"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"川後ひなちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"橋本ななみちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒りなちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大和りなちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"松村さゆりちゃん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と見ました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やっぱり凄く可愛くて勉強になりました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで沸いてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"生駒ちゃんは\n【チームB 推し】\nの曲で史上最強に沸いてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（以前コメントで、皆の名前を入れて歌詞を替えて歌を作ってくれた方がいて嬉しかったです♪）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなで『かわいー』\nを連発して\nみんなで沸いてました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あんな凄いグループになれたらいいなっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドルっぽいかなりんと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前回のホクロは分かりにくかったですよね...でも中にはなぁちゃんのブログでわかった方も居ましたね...笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今度はどんな事をしようかな〜笑笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それから受験生の皆さん頑張って下さい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"合格するように祈ってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんが最近頑張っていることは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"BYE"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/maaya.wada/img/2013/01/12/8222052/0014.gif","alt":""}],"source":"archive"}